uml:
@startuml
title 2.2 Multi-Warehouse Replenishment and Internal Transfer (BF-02)

scale 1400 width

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam activityBorderColor #666666
skinparam activityBackgroundColor #FDFDFD
skinparam activityDiamondBackgroundColor #FFF4D6
skinparam activityDiamondBorderColor #888888
skinparam activityArrowColor #666666

|System|
start
:Detect stock shortage at destination warehouse\nor branch warehouse;

|Inventory Staff|
:Review shortage and source warehouse options;
:Create internal transfer request;

|System|
:Validate source warehouse,\ndestination warehouse,\navailable stock, reserved stock,\nand requested transfer quantity;

|Store Owner|
:Review transfer request;

if (Approve transfer request?) then (Yes)
    |System|
    :Approve internal transfer request;
    :Generate transfer order;
else (No)
    |System|
    :Reject transfer request;
    stop
endif

|Inventory Staff|
:At source warehouse,\nallocate stock by lot;
:Pick goods from source locations;
:Prepare transfer shipment;

|System|
:Validate picked quantity and lot allocation;

|Inventory Staff|
:Confirm transfer issue from source warehouse;

|System|
:Deduct stock from source warehouse;
:Mark transfer as In Transit;

|Inventory Staff|
:Receive transfer shipment\nat destination warehouse;
:Check quantity, lot,\nand physical condition;

if (Discrepancy or damage found?) then (Yes)
    :Record transfer discrepancy;

    |Store Owner|
    :Review discrepancy handling;

    if (Accept partial receipt?) then (Yes)
        |System|
        :Create partial transfer receipt;
        :Keep unresolved quantity under exception handling;
    else (No)
        |System|
        :Reject affected quantity;
        :Create return-back handling\nfor unresolved quantity;
    endif
endif

|Inventory Staff|
:Assign destination storage location;
:Create transfer receipt;

|System|
:Update stock at destination warehouse\nas Pending Inspection or Available;

|Inventory Staff|
:Perform final inspection if required;

if (Inspection passed?) then (Yes)
    |System|
    :Move stock to Available status;
else (No)
    |System|
    :Move stock to Quarantine status;
endif

|System|
:Close transfer order;
:Update transfer history and inventory logs;
:Notify related users;

stop
@enduml
